{"seq":2,"slug":"tca-composable-architecture","title":"TCA 组合式架构实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/tca-composable-architecture","wordCount":497,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"tca-组合式架构实战\">TCA 组合式架构实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>The Composable Architecture（TCA）是 Point-Free 团队开源的 SwiftUI 架构框架，截至 2026 年 4 月已迭代至 1.25.x 版本。它借鉴 Elm Architecture 和 Redux 的单向数据流思想，通过五个核心组件——State、Action、Reducer、Store、Effect——将应用逻辑封装为可组合、可测试、可预测的模块。在 Swift 6 严格并发和 <code>@Observable</code> 宏的加持下，TCA 已全面拥抱 <code>@ObservableState</code> 宏替代旧有的 ViewStore 桥接层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    View --&gt;|发送 Action| Store&#10;    Store --&gt;|传递给| Reducer&#10;    Reducer --&gt;|纯函数,修改| State&#10;    Reducer --&gt;|返回| Effect&#10;    Effect --&gt;|异步结果作为新 Action| Store&#10;    State --&gt;|驱动| View\">flowchart TD\n    View --&gt;|发送 Action| Store\n    Store --&gt;|传递给| Reducer\n    Reducer --&gt;|纯函数,修改| State\n    Reducer --&gt;|返回| Effect\n    Effect --&gt;|异步结果作为新 Action| Store\n    State --&gt;|驱动| View</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>State</td>\n<td>功能模块的全量数据快照</td>\n<td>值类型 struct + <code>@ObservableState</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Action</td>\n<td>用户事件或系统回调的枚举</td>\n<td>enum + <code>@CasePathable</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reducer</td>\n<td>接收 Action、修改 State、返回 Effect 的纯函数</td>\n<td><code>@Reducer</code> 宏标注的 struct</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Store</td>\n<td>运行时容器，持有 State 并分发 Action</td>\n<td><code>StoreOf&lt;Feature&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Effect</td>\n<td>描述副作用（网络、定时器、系统 API）</td>\n<td><code>Effect&lt;Action&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"reducer-定义与组合\">Reducer 定义与组合</h2><p>TCA 1.7+ 引入 <code>@Reducer</code> 宏，大幅减少样板代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import ComposableArchitecture&#10;&#10;@Reducer&#10;struct CounterFeature {&#10;    @ObservableState&#10;    struct State: Equatable {&#10;        var count = 0&#10;        var numberFact: String?&#10;        var isLoadingFact = false&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    enum Action {&#10;        case incrementButtonTapped&#10;        case decrementButtonTapped&#10;        case factButtonTapped&#10;        case factResponse(String)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    var body: some ReducerOf&lt;Self&gt; {&#10;        Reduce { state, action in&#10;            switch action {&#10;            case .incrementButtonTapped:&#10;                state.count += 1&#10;                return .none&#10;&#10;            case .decrementButtonTapped:&#10;                state.count -= 1&#10;                return .none&#10;&#10;            case .factButtonTapped:&#10;                state.isLoadingFact = true&#10;                return .run { [count = state.count] send in&#10;                    let (data, _) = try await URLSession.shared.data(&#10;                        from: URL(string: &quot;http://numbersapi.com/\\(count)&quot;)!&#10;                    )&#10;                    let fact = String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)&#10;                    await send(.factResponse(fact))&#10;                }&#10;&#10;            case .factResponse(let fact):&#10;                state.isLoadingFact = false&#10;                state.numberFact = fact&#10;                return .none&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ComposableArchitecture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Reducer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CounterFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ObservableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numberFact: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isLoadingFact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> incrementButtonTapped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c