or:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onboardingComplete </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Shared</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"currentUser\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentUser: User</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TCA 用单向数据流 + Reducer 组合实现了可预测、可测试的 SwiftUI 架构</li>\n<li><code>@ObservableState</code> 替代旧版 ViewStore，直接享受属性级精准刷新</li>\n<li>Effect + <code>@Dependency</code> 让副作用可控、可 Mock</li>\n<li>TestStore 提供步进式行为验证，覆盖状态变化和异步 Effect</li>\n<li>适合中大型应用；小型应用可先用 <code>@Observable</code> + 轻量 ViewModel 过渡</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((TCA 核心))&#10;    State&#10;      值类型&#10;      @ObservableState&#10;    Action&#10;      枚举&#10;      @CasePathable&#10;    Reducer&#10;      纯函数&#10;      可组合&#10;    Effect&#10;      异步描述&#10;      依赖注入&#10;    Store&#10;      运行时容器&#10;      View 绑定\">mindmap\n  root((TCA 核心))\n    State\n      值类型\n      @ObservableState\n    Action\n      枚举\n      @CasePathable\n    Reducer\n      纯函数\n      可组合\n    Effect\n      异步描述\n      依赖注入\n    Store\n      运行时容器\n      View 绑定</pre><h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"observable-state-management\">本章：@Observable 宏与精准状态追踪</a> — @Observable 的底层机制，TCA 构建在其之上</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/tca-composable-architecture\">iOS 架构 - TCA 组合式架构</a> — 从架构模式对比视角理解 TCA 的定位</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../swift-language-advanced/concurrency/actors\">Swift 语言进阶 - Actors</a> — Swift 并发模型中 Actor 隔离与 TCA 的 MainActor 要求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TCA 组合式架构实战","id":"tca-组合式架构实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Reducer 定义与组合","id":"reducer-定义与组合"},{"level":2,"text":"子模块组合与 Scope","id":"子模块组合与-scope"},{"level":2,"text":"副作用管理：Effect 与依赖注入","id":"副作用管理-effect-与依赖注入"},{"level":2,"text":"TestStore 行为验证","id":"teststore-行为验证"},{"level":2,"text":"@Shared 状态与跨 Feature 通信","id":"shared-状态与跨-feature-通信"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"@Observable 宏与精准状态追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/observable-state-management"},"next":{"title":"类型安全导航架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/navigation-architecture"}}